                <l xml:id="m-43052b49-cc10-41ae-a715-8df7a35de845" facs="#m-56ebe415-ab15-4eb3-9ad0-6c0a36964935" label="text-like">216 Magnificat. The Solemn Tones 4. E, A. A". — S. a.</l><l xml:id="m-c0d9bf81-7028-43cb-b349-8f0ed79c3aa5" facs="#m-27ad25ac-afa5-409d-98a4-a06c7a3d5ec0" label="ambiguous">Tone 4. E. A. A*.</l><l xml:id="m-f2cc459b-2c1b-4a12-86fd-567fbb659361" facs="#m-54645acf-c87a-4fa7-ae66-dd7a84da78c4" label="text-like">Endings ofr accent with 3 prepara¬</l><l xml:id="m-cb358e2e-7180-4730-b134-3de0c9a10c70" facs="#m-64b2c1de-e23c-468c-beef-f27bc884a166" label="text-like">Mediant of r accent with 3 preparatory</l><l xml:id="m-f500dd19-932b-4f40-a55d-27bb6ee4f91c" facs="#m-dd3584ae-21d5-4269-8084-3d22a1c0ee2a" label="lyrics-like">tory srllables. (For the Endinz É. an</l><l xml:id="m-1f41e4bb-9e02-4b8b-a1d2-54e06d8130b6" facs="#m-0b16444f-66f7-487b-8202-7fa531a19033" label="ambiguous">"llables.</l><l xml:id="m-f40da1a9-8c08-42b9-b584-55ffeffcced4" facs="#m-da3a96e6-c01f-4d20-b288-e232867f4174" label="text-like">extra note is added in anticipation ot</l><l xml:id="m-2ba4f976-f9d0-402a-906c-eb24c226e11f" facs="#m-2455a254-1929-4ca8-a137-b1ad920ffc2e" label="text-like">the accent in dactylic cadences).</l><l xml:id="m-24173aab-c7ba-4b55-aa11-67d322fac21a" facs="#m-ee679e19-0bc2-46ac-ab79-15c045cbdf35" label="ambiguous">— E</l><l xml:id="m-c898c758-d96d-4fa5-ac3b-818383283637" facs="#m-ecf1d9ea-ecde-473c-8040-656579638d5b" label="ambiguous">1. Magni-fi-cat"</l><l xml:id="m-4ffa1a37-19ff-4ec2-9785-b053df4f5daa" facs="#m-b38266f9-cf17-4acf-886f-72b6dc83e47b" label="lyrics-like">â-nima mé-a Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-0ed6dde1-5ed9-426f-8b41-7a66e1aac58c" facs="#m-2bf83a09-6a68-4a42-8ded-796abfa7e830" label="lyrics-like">2. Et exsultávit spl-ri-tus mé¬ us in Dé-o sa-lu-tá-ri mé-o.</l><l xml:id="m-d54f9888-b780-48d3-b2ef-3ceea427e06b" facs="#m-aee26d9d-37a1-499f-8cf1-0162087bf882" label="ambiguous">4</l><l xml:id="m-e5c519e7-1ed2-4c86-b287-c48a1410d70c"